 "descriptor": "Steroid and hormone API maker building injectables and fermentation CDMO",
 "lede": "Symbiotec (listed Sep 2026) makes steroid and hormone APIs from soyabean sterols and has spent over ₹1,000 Cr building two new businesses: complex injectables (a US dual-chamber-vial deal, ₹53 Cr of milestones in Q2) and fermentation CDMO with take-or-pay customers. FY27 guidance is about 20% revenue and 25% EBITDA growth, but new revenue is 6-12 months away and the stock is at 66x earnings.",
