     "type": "text",
     "text": "Symbiotec makes 60+ corticosteroid and hormone APIs (44 US DMFs, 25 European CEPs), is backward-integrated into phytosterol fermentation, and is adding two forward businesses: fermentation CDMO for biopharma and biomanufacturing (Ujjain, 400 KL) and complex injectables (dual-chamber vials, US partner).",
